{"id":"forecast-12","section":4,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-12/audio-4.mp3","model":"small","duration":414.54,"segments":[{"start":1.74,"end":7.2,"text":"Section 4 You will hear a lecturer giving a talk to some","words":[["Section",1.74,2.36],["4",2.36,2.88],["You",2.88,4.64],["will",4.64,4.8],["hear",4.8,5.0],["a",5.0,5.28],["lecturer",5.28,5.72],["giving",5.72,6.34],["a",6.34,6.6],["talk",6.6,6.8],["to",6.8,7.02],["some",7.02,7.2]]},{"start":7.2,"end":14.68,"text":"engineering students about ethics in engineering. First, you have some time to look at questions","words":[["engineering",7.2,7.68],["students",7.68,8.26],["about",8.26,9.2],["ethics",9.2,9.94],["in",9.94,10.28],["engineering.",10.28,10.88],["First,",11.76,12.44],["you",12.98,13.14],["have",13.14,13.32],["some",13.32,13.52],["time",13.52,13.84],["to",13.84,14.06],["look",14.06,14.18],["at",14.18,14.32],["questions",14.32,14.68]]},{"start":14.68,"end":71.67,"text":"31 to 40 on page 7. Now listen carefully and answer questions 31 to 40.","words":[["31",14.68,15.52],["to",15.52,15.78],["40",15.78,16.2],["on",16.2,16.94],["page",16.94,17.24],["7.",17.24,17.72],["Now",67.87,68.09],["listen",68.09,68.35],["carefully",68.35,68.81],["and",68.81,69.51],["answer",69.51,69.81],["questions",69.81,70.23],["31",70.23,71.07],["to",71.07,71.31],["40.",71.31,71.67]]},{"start":74.89,"end":81.83,"text":"Good afternoon. Today we're starting a series of lectures on ethics in engineering, that","words":[["Good",74.89,75.35],["afternoon.",75.35,75.87],["Today",76.95,77.31],["we're",77.31,77.57],["starting",77.57,77.93],["a",77.93,78.17],["series",78.17,78.39],["of",78.39,78.65],["lectures",78.65,78.97],["on",78.97,79.39],["ethics",79.39,79.87],["in",79.87,80.43],["engineering,",80.43,81.09],["that",81.59,81.83]]},{"start":81.83,"end":87.97,"text":"That is, engineering principles relating to right and wrong conduct, and the sorts of moral","words":[["That",81.83,81.93],["is,",81.93,82.07],["engineering",82.71,82.71],["principles",82.71,83.33],["relating",83.33,83.91],["to",83.91,84.35],["right",84.35,84.67],["and",84.67,85.05],["wrong",85.05,85.43],["conduct,",85.43,86.13],["and",86.55,87.05],["the",87.05,87.19],["sorts",87.19,87.39],["of",87.39,87.61],["moral",87.61,87.97]]},{"start":87.97,"end":92.39,"text":"responsibilities that you will have to uphold in your professional lives.","words":[["responsibilities",87.97,88.79],["that",88.79,89.49],["you",89.49,89.67],["will",89.67,89.79],["have",89.79,90.01],["to",90.01,90.13],["uphold",90.13,90.75],["in",90.75,91.07],["your",91.07,91.21],["professional",91.21,91.73],["lives.",91.73,92.39]]},{"start":93.07,"end":98.77,"text":"I'm going to start by giving you a brief outline of the history of ethics in engineering.","words":[["I'm",93.07,93.67],["going",93.67,93.75],["to",93.75,93.91],["start",93.91,94.19],["by",94.19,94.49],["giving",94.49,94.71],["you",94.71,94.91],["a",94.91,95.03],["brief",95.03,95.25],["outline",95.25,95.85],["of",95.85,96.55],["the",96.55,96.67],["history",96.67,97.07],["of",97.07,97.57],["ethics",97.57,97.95],["in",97.95,98.23],["engineering.",98.23,98.77]]},{"start":99.51,"end":105.43,"text":"It was of course only in the 19th century that engineering really emerged as a profession.","words":[["It",99.51,99.99],["was",99.99,100.15],["of",100.15,100.31],["course",100.31,100.55],["only",100.55,100.95],["in",100.95,101.09],["the",101.09,101.17],["19th",101.17,102.31],["century",102.31,102.31],["that",102.31,102.63],["engineering",102.63,103.31],["really",103.31,104.01],["emerged",104.01,104.67],["as",104.67,104.97],["a",104.97,105.09],["profession.",105.09,105.43]]},{"start":105.43,"end":111.95,"text":"Initially, ethical issues were considered to be a personal matter, something to be decided","words":[["Initially,",105.43,106.67],["ethical",107.27,107.61],["issues",107.61,108.13],["were",108.13,108.37],["considered",108.37,108.81],["to",108.81,109.07],["be",109.07,109.29],["a",109.29,109.61],["personal",109.61,110.07],["matter,",110.07,110.55],["something",110.85,111.09],["to",111.09,111.39],["be",111.39,111.49],["decided",111.49,111.95]]},{"start":111.95,"end":115.27,"text":"in accordance with one's own principles and values.","words":[["in",111.95,112.35],["accordance",112.35,112.71],["with",112.71,113.19],["one's",113.19,113.61],["own",113.61,113.79],["principles",113.79,114.33],["and",114.33,114.85],["values.",114.85,115.27]]},{"start":116.37,"end":123.27,"text":"However, things gradually changed as the profession grew and as engineering projects became larger","words":[["However,",116.37,116.71],["things",116.89,117.07],["gradually",117.07,117.69],["changed",117.69,118.33],["as",118.33,119.09],["the",119.09,119.25],["profession",119.25,119.61],["grew",119.61,120.11],["and",120.11,120.87],["as",120.87,121.13],["engineering",121.13,121.59],["projects",121.59,122.25],["became",122.25,122.77],["larger",122.77,123.27]]},{"start":123.27,"end":124.55,"text":"and more complex.","words":[["and",123.27,123.71],["more",123.71,123.93],["complex.",123.93,124.55]]},{"start":125.43,"end":131.75,"text":"A need began to be felt for a more codified set of principles that all engineers would","words":[["A",125.43,125.71],["need",125.71,126.05],["began",126.05,126.47],["to",126.47,126.71],["be",126.71,126.83],["felt",126.83,127.11],["for",127.11,127.63],["a",127.63,127.79],["more",127.79,128.01],["codified",128.01,128.77],["set",128.77,129.33],["of",129.33,129.61],["principles",129.61,129.99],["that",129.99,130.43],["all",130.43,130.71],["engineers",130.71,131.21],["would",131.21,131.75]]},{"start":131.75,"end":132.59,"text":"agree to follow.","words":[["agree",131.75,132.07],["to",132.07,132.27],["follow.",132.27,132.59]]},{"start":132.59,"end":139.27,"text":"though. Unfortunately, it took three major disasters to bring about this change in attitude.","words":[["though.",132.59,132.71],["Unfortunately,",133.49,134.17],["it",134.59,134.71],["took",134.71,134.95],["three",134.95,135.31],["major",135.31,136.09],["disasters",136.09,136.87],["to",136.87,137.27],["bring",137.27,137.45],["about",137.45,137.79],["this",137.79,138.13],["change",138.13,138.55],["in",138.55,138.77],["attitude.",138.77,139.27]]},{"start":140.15,"end":146.75,"text":"All three of these involved the collapse of bridges. The first, known as the Ashtabula","words":[["All",140.15,140.45],["three",140.45,140.71],["of",140.71,140.87],["these",140.87,141.15],["involved",141.15,141.93],["the",141.93,142.29],["collapse",142.29,142.79],["of",142.79,143.13],["bridges.",143.13,143.49],["The",144.57,144.83],["first,",144.83,145.19],["known",145.45,145.69],["as",145.69,145.91],["the",145.91,146.03],["Ashtabula",146.03,146.75]]},{"start":146.75,"end":153.69,"text":"River Railroad Disaster, happened in 1876 in the USA, and we now think it was probably","words":[["River",146.75,147.13],["Railroad",147.13,147.93],["Disaster,",147.93,148.51],["happened",148.67,148.95],["in",148.95,149.21],["1876",149.21,150.29],["in",150.29,151.07],["the",151.07,151.17],["USA,",151.17,151.59],["and",151.93,152.07],["we",152.07,152.25],["now",152.25,152.49],["think",152.49,152.79],["it",152.79,153.01],["was",153.01,153.23],["probably",153.23,153.69]]},{"start":153.69,"end":161.01,"text":"caused by metal fatigue. Then in 1879 there was a second disaster, this time in Scotland.","words":[["caused",153.69,154.11],["by",154.11,154.41],["metal",154.41,155.03],["fatigue.",155.03,155.51],["Then",156.55,156.97],["in",156.97,157.15],["1879",157.15,158.13],["there",158.13,158.63],["was",158.63,158.85],["a",158.85,159.03],["second",159.03,159.33],["disaster,",159.33,159.99],["this",160.07,160.25],["time",160.25,160.51],["in",160.51,160.65],["Scotland.",160.65,161.01]]},{"start":161.01,"end":168.61,"text":"This occurred because engineers had failed to correctly calculate the effects that wind would have on the structure.","words":[["This",161.01,161.95],["occurred",161.95,162.35],["because",162.35,162.69],["engineers",162.69,163.21],["had",163.21,163.59],["failed",163.59,163.99],["to",163.99,164.23],["correctly",164.23,164.71],["calculate",164.71,165.31],["the",165.31,165.67],["effects",165.67,166.09],["that",166.09,166.63],["wind",166.63,167.07],["would",167.07,167.55],["have",167.55,167.87],["on",167.87,168.13],["the",168.13,168.25],["structure.",168.25,168.61]]},{"start":169.47,"end":176.97,"text":"The third collapse occurred in 1907 in Canada. This was also due to an engineering design problem.","words":[["The",169.47,170.01],["third",170.01,170.29],["collapse",170.29,170.71],["occurred",170.71,171.13],["in",171.13,171.35],["1907",171.35,172.17],["in",172.17,172.67],["Canada.",172.67,173.09],["This",173.73,173.97],["was",173.97,174.13],["also",174.13,174.55],["due",174.55,174.83],["to",174.83,175.01],["an",175.01,175.17],["engineering",175.17,175.79],["design",175.79,176.41],["problem.",176.41,176.97]]},{"start":177.47,"end":182.67,"text":"The weight of the structure was so great that it could not support itself and it collapsed.","words":[["The",177.47,177.59],["weight",177.59,177.91],["of",177.91,178.23],["the",178.23,178.33],["structure",178.33,178.73],["was",178.73,178.99],["so",178.99,179.27],["great",179.27,179.67],["that",179.67,180.23],["it",180.23,180.35],["could",180.35,180.49],["not",180.49,180.75],["support",180.75,181.13],["itself",181.13,181.63],["and",181.63,182.11],["it",182.11,182.25],["collapsed.",182.25,182.67]]},{"start":182.67,"end":188.81,"text":"types. Public outcry over disasters such as these eventually led to the establishment","words":[["types.",182.67,182.77],["Public",183.23,183.89],["outcry",183.89,184.49],["over",184.49,184.81],["disasters",184.81,185.37],["such",185.37,185.79],["as",185.79,185.99],["these",185.99,186.29],["eventually",186.29,187.31],["led",187.31,187.89],["to",187.89,188.09],["the",188.09,188.19],["establishment",188.19,188.81]]},{"start":188.81,"end":194.17,"text":"of professional societies for engineers in most industrializing societies.","words":[["of",188.81,189.13],["professional",189.13,189.63],["societies",189.63,190.49],["for",190.49,190.77],["engineers",190.77,191.35],["in",191.35,191.87],["most",191.87,192.27],["industrializing",192.27,193.57],["societies.",193.57,194.17]]},{"start":195.51,"end":200.77,"text":"Another different type of disaster also had an impact on the development of professional","words":[["Another",195.51,195.97],["different",195.97,196.55],["type",196.55,196.99],["of",196.99,197.15],["disaster",197.15,197.57],["also",197.57,198.07],["had",198.07,198.39],["an",198.39,198.53],["impact",198.53,198.99],["on",198.99,199.37],["the",199.37,199.51],["development",199.51,199.97],["of",199.97,200.31],["professional",200.31,200.77]]},{"start":200.77,"end":205.59,"text":"engineering organizations, and I'd like to talk about this in a little more detail.","words":[["engineering",200.77,201.49],["organizations,",201.49,202.19],["and",202.81,202.93],["I'd",202.93,203.09],["like",203.09,203.21],["to",203.21,203.37],["talk",203.37,203.69],["about",203.69,203.99],["this",203.99,204.33],["in",204.33,204.63],["a",204.63,204.77],["little",204.77,204.91],["more",204.91,205.15],["detail.",205.15,205.59]]},{"start":205.59,"end":212.29,"text":"sale. This incident, which happened early in the 20th century, is known as the Boston","words":[["sale.",205.59,205.79],["This",206.51,207.11],["incident,",207.11,207.61],["which",207.85,208.49],["happened",208.49,208.77],["early",208.77,209.13],["in",209.13,209.35],["the",209.35,209.45],["20th",209.45,209.97],["century,",209.97,210.27],["is",210.57,210.69],["known",210.69,211.01],["as",211.01,211.65],["the",211.65,211.79],["Boston",211.79,212.29]]},{"start":212.29,"end":219.29,"text":"Molasses Disaster. At the time, molasses was used rather than sugar as the principal","words":[["Molasses",212.29,213.27],["Disaster.",213.27,214.15],["At",215.05,215.51],["the",215.51,215.59],["time,",215.59,215.97],["molasses",216.35,216.75],["was",216.75,217.01],["used",217.01,217.29],["rather",217.29,217.69],["than",217.69,217.91],["sugar",217.91,218.27],["as",218.27,218.77],["the",218.77,218.91],["principal",218.91,219.29]]},{"start":219.29,"end":225.77,"text":"sweetener in the USA. It was also used in the manufacture of a number of other important","words":[["sweetener",219.29,219.95],["in",219.95,220.33],["the",220.33,220.45],["USA.",220.45,220.89],["It",221.81,221.99],["was",221.99,222.11],["also",222.11,222.51],["used",222.51,222.91],["in",222.91,223.19],["the",223.19,223.29],["manufacture",223.29,223.75],["of",223.75,224.23],["a",224.23,224.35],["number",224.35,224.61],["of",224.61,224.81],["other",224.81,225.09],["important",225.09,225.77]]},{"start":225.77,"end":232.65,"text":"products. One company in the city of Boston had a large amount of molasses waiting to","words":[["products.",225.77,226.27],["One",227.17,227.77],["company",227.77,228.33],["in",228.33,228.55],["the",228.55,228.67],["city",228.67,228.85],["of",228.85,229.01],["Boston",229.01,229.45],["had",229.45,230.23],["a",230.23,230.37],["large",230.37,230.65],["amount",230.65,231.01],["of",231.01,231.37],["molasses",231.37,231.87],["waiting",231.87,232.29],["to",232.29,232.65]]},{"start":232.65,"end":239.53,"text":"be transferred to another factory. The molasses, more than eight million liters of thick, sticky","words":[["be",232.65,232.79],["transferred",232.79,233.19],["to",233.19,233.55],["another",233.55,233.89],["factory.",233.89,234.33],["The",235.13,235.27],["molasses,",235.27,235.79],["more",236.31,236.49],["than",236.49,236.67],["eight",236.67,236.99],["million",236.99,237.55],["liters",237.55,238.11],["of",238.11,238.69],["thick,",238.69,239.05],["sticky",239.17,239.53]]},{"start":239.53,"end":247.25,"text":"liquid, were stored in a tank. Suddenly, this collapsed, unleashing a wave of molasses up","words":[["liquid,",239.53,239.93],["were",240.65,240.91],["stored",240.91,241.17],["in",241.17,241.45],["a",241.45,241.59],["tank.",241.59,241.93],["Suddenly,",242.83,243.43],["this",243.69,243.95],["collapsed,",243.95,244.61],["unleashing",245.05,245.51],["a",245.51,245.73],["wave",245.73,246.15],["of",246.15,246.49],["molasses",246.49,246.99],["up",246.99,247.25]]},{"start":247.25,"end":253.07,"text":"to five meters high. Nearby buildings were swept off their foundations and crashed to","words":[["to",247.25,247.39],["five",247.39,247.75],["meters",247.75,248.15],["high.",248.15,248.65],["Nearby",249.35,249.75],["buildings",249.75,250.17],["were",250.17,250.53],["swept",250.53,250.83],["off",250.83,251.15],["their",251.15,251.37],["foundations",251.37,252.01],["and",252.01,252.39],["crashed",252.39,252.83],["to",252.83,253.07]]},{"start":253.07,"end":260.27,"text":"the ground. The wave also swept away a considerable stretch of railway track. Many streets round","words":[["the",253.07,253.17],["ground.",253.17,253.47],["The",254.39,254.57],["wave",254.57,254.81],["also",254.81,255.31],["swept",255.31,255.71],["away",255.71,255.99],["a",255.99,256.19],["considerable",256.19,256.61],["stretch",256.61,256.99],["of",256.99,257.21],["railway",257.21,257.57],["track.",257.57,258.09],["Many",259.05,259.33],["streets",259.33,259.73],["round",259.73,260.27]]},{"start":260.27,"end":270.79,"text":"the factory were covered with a thick layer of sticky brown molasses. Local residents","words":[["the",260.27,260.43],["factory",260.43,260.81],["were",260.81,261.37],["covered",261.37,261.81],["with",261.81,262.09],["a",262.09,262.25],["thick",262.25,262.49],["layer",262.49,262.93],["of",262.93,263.19],["sticky",263.19,263.55],["brown",263.55,264.01],["molasses.",264.01,264.61],["Local",270.03,270.37],["residents",270.37,270.79]]},{"start":270.79,"end":276.83,"text":"were furious as they felt that the company was to blame. They banded together and succeeded","words":[["were",270.79,271.13],["furious",271.13,271.63],["as",271.63,272.27],["they",272.27,272.43],["felt",272.43,272.71],["that",272.71,272.89],["the",272.89,272.99],["company",272.99,273.49],["was",273.49,273.83],["to",273.83,273.99],["blame.",273.99,274.33],["They",274.95,275.13],["banded",275.13,275.61],["together",275.61,275.99],["and",275.99,276.39],["succeeded",276.39,276.83]]},{"start":276.83,"end":283.51,"text":"in bringing about a trial, charging the company with negligence. After three years, the company","words":[["in",276.83,277.17],["bringing",277.17,277.45],["about",277.45,277.77],["a",277.77,277.99],["trial,",277.99,278.39],["charging",278.97,279.39],["the",279.39,279.71],["company",279.71,280.15],["with",280.15,280.49],["negligence.",280.49,281.15],["After",281.81,282.23],["three",282.23,282.51],["years,",282.51,282.97],["the",283.13,283.17],["company",283.17,283.51]]},{"start":283.51,"end":289.39,"text":"was found responsible for the accident and required to pay out in damages the equivalent","words":[["was",283.51,283.79],["found",283.79,284.17],["responsible",284.17,284.95],["for",284.95,285.35],["the",285.35,285.45],["accident",285.45,285.91],["and",285.91,286.69],["required",286.69,287.13],["to",287.13,287.45],["pay",287.45,287.67],["out",287.67,288.01],["in",288.01,288.17],["damages",288.17,288.63],["the",288.63,288.95],["equivalent",288.95,289.39]]},{"start":289.39,"end":297.19,"text":"equivalent of six or seven million dollars in today's money. Even today, no one is absolutely","words":[["equivalent",289.39,289.57],["of",289.57,290.23],["six",290.23,290.59],["or",290.59,290.83],["seven",290.83,291.19],["million",291.19,291.67],["dollars",291.67,292.27],["in",292.27,292.57],["today's",292.57,293.07],["money.",293.07,293.29],["Even",294.21,294.85],["today,",294.85,295.27],["no",295.79,296.05],["one",296.05,296.35],["is",296.35,296.61],["absolutely",296.61,297.19]]},{"start":297.19,"end":303.59,"text":"sure about the immediate causes of the accident. However, it is certainly clear that not enough","words":[["sure",297.19,297.73],["about",297.73,298.11],["the",298.11,298.33],["immediate",298.33,298.77],["causes",298.77,299.33],["of",299.33,299.83],["the",299.83,299.93],["accident.",299.93,300.33],["However,",301.07,301.51],["it",301.65,301.77],["is",301.77,301.91],["certainly",301.91,302.25],["clear",302.25,302.69],["that",302.69,302.95],["not",302.95,303.23],["enough",303.23,303.59]]},{"start":303.59,"end":309.25,"text":"safety tests were carried out. Had these been done in accordance with the standards now","words":[["safety",303.59,304.01],["tests",304.01,304.55],["were",304.55,304.83],["carried",304.83,305.17],["out.",305.17,305.47],["Had",306.13,306.45],["these",306.45,306.77],["been",306.77,307.09],["done",307.09,307.43],["in",307.43,307.73],["accordance",307.73,308.01],["with",308.01,308.43],["the",308.43,308.57],["standards",308.57,308.93],["now",308.93,309.25]]},{"start":309.25,"end":313.29,"text":"applicable, then the accident would almost certainly have been prevented.","words":[["applicable,",309.25,309.73],["then",310.19,310.49],["the",310.49,310.65],["accident",310.65,311.15],["would",311.15,311.37],["almost",311.37,311.83],["certainly",311.83,312.33],["have",312.33,312.61],["been",312.61,312.75],["prevented.",312.75,313.29]]},{"start":313.29,"end":320.77,"text":"it. It seems that the collapse was probably brought about by fermentation of the molasses,","words":[["it.",313.29,313.45],["It",314.33,314.83],["seems",314.83,315.21],["that",315.21,315.75],["the",315.75,315.87],["collapse",315.87,316.39],["was",316.39,316.77],["probably",316.77,317.37],["brought",317.37,317.69],["about",317.69,318.03],["by",318.03,318.31],["fermentation",318.31,319.15],["of",319.15,320.17],["the",320.17,320.27],["molasses,",320.27,320.77]]},{"start":321.03,"end":327.01,"text":"which led to an increase in pressure. This increase probably exerted too much force","words":[["which",321.03,321.19],["led",321.19,321.39],["to",321.39,321.65],["an",321.65,321.77],["increase",321.77,322.17],["in",322.17,322.51],["pressure.",322.51,322.87],["This",323.71,323.95],["increase",323.95,324.55],["probably",324.55,325.39],["exerted",325.39,326.07],["too",326.07,326.29],["much",326.29,326.59],["force",326.59,327.01]]},{"start":327.01,"end":334.05,"text":"against a fatigue crack or some other weakness. However, this was one of the main incidents","words":[["against",327.01,327.31],["a",327.31,327.59],["fatigue",327.59,328.05],["crack",328.05,328.55],["or",328.55,328.99],["some",328.99,329.47],["other",329.47,329.87],["weakness.",329.87,330.33],["However,",331.55,332.17],["this",332.25,332.47],["was",332.47,332.67],["one",332.67,332.89],["of",332.89,332.99],["the",332.99,333.11],["main",333.11,333.45],["incidents",333.45,334.05]]},{"start":334.05,"end":341.43,"text":"which led to increased legislation in the 1920s to regulate engineers and the engineering","words":[["which",334.05,334.39],["led",334.39,334.65],["to",334.65,334.93],["increased",334.93,335.59],["legislation",335.59,336.69],["in",336.69,337.09],["the",337.09,337.17],["1920s",337.17,338.27],["to",338.27,338.87],["regulate",338.87,339.37],["engineers",339.37,340.21],["and",340.21,340.67],["the",340.67,340.87],["engineering",340.87,341.43]]},{"start":341.43,"end":348.65,"text":"profession. It is the reason why we can now only operate if we have gained a license.","words":[["profession.",341.43,341.81],["It",342.73,343.01],["is",343.01,343.15],["the",343.15,343.29],["reason",343.29,343.69],["why",343.69,344.33],["we",344.33,344.63],["can",344.63,344.95],["now",344.95,345.31],["only",345.31,345.85],["operate",345.85,346.51],["if",346.51,347.15],["we",347.15,347.35],["have",347.35,347.57],["gained",347.57,347.97],["a",347.97,348.25],["license.",348.25,348.65]]},{"start":349.63,"end":356.79,"text":"This requires us always to be conscientious about doing everything necessary to avoid disasters,","words":[["This",349.63,349.99],["requires",349.99,350.55],["us",350.55,350.99],["always",350.99,351.55],["to",351.55,351.85],["be",351.85,352.07],["conscientious",352.07,353.39],["about",353.39,353.77],["doing",353.77,